# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local Claude settings (keep .claude/skills and .claude/settings.json tracked)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Scratch
scratch/
*.tmp

# Rulebooks. The PDFs and their extracted text live in a `Dnd Books/` directory
# alongside this repo — deliberately, because they're copyrighted. These patterns
# are a safety net against an accidental copy-in. See .claude/reference/books.md.
#
# NOTE: `*.pdf` is deliberately broad, so it will also catch a PDF you actually
# want to keep — a printable handout or map, say. That's the trade: silently
# ignoring your own file is recoverable, committing a rulebook isn't. To keep one
# on purpose, force it: `git add -f campaigns/current/<path>.pdf`
*.pdf
_text/
phb-*.txt
dmg-*.txt
mm-*.txt

# Python bytecode from .claude/tools/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
